  "sourceTitle": "FreeToken vs llama.cpp on one RTX 3090: llama.cpp is 2–3× faster when the MoE fits in VRAM. On gpt-oss-120b (63 GB), FreeToken gets the first token out 7× faster at 32 concurrent users.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "55be92cb7326ef187aea75661b3551f666e13fbd2910681bc909f3cf2dab56f5",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
